@title Hoist in 3D at 1920x1080 draws the end limits of a picked travel axis as upright flags on the runway
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# The travel fixture has a forward end limit at 6 m; the flag stands at the bridge start plus 6 m.
open qa/fixtures/travel-drive.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist in 3D
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
shot before-pick
click_text "none"
wait 10
click_text "=A1+FLD-M1"
wait 20
click_text "Front"
wait 40
shot flag-on-runway
check_layout
